{"id":1103,"date":"2017-02-27T12:40:02","date_gmt":"2017-02-27T12:40:02","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.eleanorgail.co.uk\/?p=1103"},"modified":"2021-02-03T16:08:06","modified_gmt":"2021-02-03T16:08:06","slug":"best-friends-wedding-llangoed-hall","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wedding-planner\/best-friends-wedding-llangoed-hall\/","title":{"rendered":"Nicky and Dave&#8217;s Wedding at Llangoed Hall"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-1 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;--awb-flex-wrap:wrap;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start fusion-flex-content-wrap\" style=\"max-width:calc( 1100px + 0px );margin-left: calc(-0px \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-0px \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-0 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:100%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:0px;--awb-margin-bottom-large:0px;--awb-spacing-left-large:0px;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-spacing-right-medium:0px;--awb-spacing-left-medium:0px;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-spacing-right-small:0px;--awb-spacing-left-small:0px;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-1\"><p>Isn&#8217;t it amazing when a mutual friend introduces you to your future significant other? And did you know nearly 40% of couples now meet through a mutual friend? That&#8217;s way more than internet dating, at work or clubs! We all know friendships play a key role in our lives, they know us inside and out, the good and the bad. It&#8217;s no wonder they would be best placed to be a matchmaker too!<\/p>\n<p>Introduced through a mutual friend, Nicky &amp; Dave met 3 years ago on a blind date. But living over 100 miles apart meant getting to know each other over the phone first before actually meeting. Their love of food, their dogs and a shared sense of humour made sure they had lots to talk about and the rest, as they say, is history. Family and friends travelled far and wide (Australia in case you were wondering) to celebrate their wedding day at the exclusive Llangoed Hall. Set in the heart of the Brecon Beacons, this beautiful venue was the perfect setting for their wedding. Ladies and Gents, it&#8217;s my pleasure to introduce you to Nicky &amp; Dave Fellowes.<\/p>\n<p>Nicky &amp; Dave have been kind enough to leave some lovely words of thanks on our <a href=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/kind-words\/\">Kind Words<\/a> page too.<\/p>\n<p>If you&#8217;d like any help with your wedding, please contact Gail on 0787 655 1592 or drop me an email on <a href=\"mailto:gail@eleanorgail.co.uk\">gail@eleanorgail.co.uk<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><div class=\"awb-gallery-wrapper awb-gallery-wrapper-1 button-span-no\"><div style=\"margin:-5px;--awb-bordersize:0px;\" class=\"fusion-gallery fusion-gallery-container fusion-grid-3 fusion-columns-total-60 fusion-gallery-layout-grid fusion-gallery-1\"><div style=\"padding:5px;\" class=\"fusion-grid-column fusion-gallery-column fusion-gallery-column-3 hover-type-none\"><div class=\"fusion-gallery-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/NickyDaveWedding-1.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\" data-rel=\"iLightbox[gallery_image_1]\" class=\"fusion-lightbox\" target=\"_self\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/NickyDaveWedding-1-460x295.jpg\" width=\"460\" height=\"295\" alt=\"\" title=\"Nicky&amp;DaveWedding-1\" aria-label=\"Nicky&amp;DaveWedding-1\" class=\"img-responsive wp-image-1102 fusion-gallery-image-size-fixed\"  \/><\/a><\/di